	"d4723b246ffebfc9d0667ee51bba3f47": "Tap a red word to hear every letter.",
	"dfa3f91b2e2aa03751567369fc6923cc": "Tap a picture, then its red word, or drag the picture onto the word.",
	"55f950b3cc4f7b80cc72e0b7531f6a53": "When every word is green, read it slowly or go to the next sentence.",
	"21cfec4c775961c1d9319a5777b6be62": "Toca una palabra roja para oír cada letra.",
	"c6b4d28841159455a2888b92493740d9": "Toca una imagen y luego su palabra roja, o arrastra la imagen.",
