	"8a2a64aa84e7d0e17e76f7663af20025": "Toca una palabra para deletrear.",
	"5dab07d7ff5048761141dead402a6227": "Lee despacio o sigue a la próxima página.",
	"0f31472626f9c352d90d8a9ad06cc1bc": "Images gives you a picture for the word you will write.",
